# Product documentation

Published corpus: `docs/**`, root `README.md`, example READMEs. The website publishes this tree.

Authoring contract and persona review live in the **internal** workspace (multi-root: `zelkor-dev.code-workspace`). Do not copy them into this repo.

| Need | Location (internal repo) |
| :--- | :--- |
| Living spec | `internal/requirements/dev/product_documentation.md` |
| Write procedure | `internal/.cursor/skills/write-product-docs/SKILL.md` |
| Persona review | `internal/.cursor/skills/review-product-docs/SKILL.md` |
| Cursor rule (full) | `internal/.cursor/rules/product-docs.mdc` |

## Do not (public pages)

- Paste `internal/` specs, Path A/B, lab hosts, pricing/GTM, or strategy jargon into `docs/` or commit messages.
- Treat `profiles/values-local.yaml` as a customer production recipe.
- Duplicate docs in a separate CMS.
